# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: PRP Open RFQ Seller Type Option (Login) (test case 2551, run 115613, last result SUCCESS)
# Tags: regression
# OFF (login): the "What are you looking for" banner shows only when signed in, and the OTP sign-in is switched off.
# OFF steps: every step that would send a REAL lead / enquiry / OTP is switched off,
#   plus the checks that only pass after it. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.

call Live_Touch_Chrome_Navigate_to_Homepage_setup_Popup
click touch_signin_home_page
click touch_contextual_signin
wait 2 seconds
type "9987996046" into rfq_mobile_number_input
wait 2 seconds
# OFF: js click touch_loginwithotp_button
# OFF: wait until element touch_home_otp_1stfield is visible
# OFF: click touch_home_otp_1stfield
wait 1 seconds
# OFF: type "537393" into focused field
wait 1 seconds
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Delhi/Scrap/jdm-1094774-ent-15-1094774?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=scrap&searchLocUpdate=0&stype=category_list&srcterm=Scrap
wait 2 seconds
# OFF: scroll until element prp_what_are_you_looking_for_seller_type_banner visible, scroll by 600 pixels, scroll count 15, scroll wait 1
# OFF: scroll to prp_what_are_you_looking_for_seller_type_banner
scroll to prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section is visible
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "All"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Wholesalers"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Importers"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Distributors"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Exporters"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Dealers"
verify element prp_open_rfq_seller_type_section contains "Buyer"
# OFF: click prp_open_rfq_seller_type_wholesaler
# OFF: verify text "Results updated successfully and your details have been sent to the relevant sellers." on page
